### Feature CashRegister (TurnoCaja) — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH) (JWT + RBAC)
### `is_active` no se envía: solo cambia con PATCH /api/turnos-caja/:id/deactivate
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### PUT — reemplazo completo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/turnos-caja/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Turno tarde",
  "descripcion": "14:00 a 22:00",
  "empleado_id": 2
}

### PATCH — parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/turnos-caja/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descripcion": "Turno con cambio de horario"
}
